        {
          "q": "Can I move my existing records in?",
          "a": "You can enter opening stock and outstanding dues directly, which is what most yards do on day one. For larger histories, get in touch and we will help with a bulk import."
        },
        {
          "q": "What happens to my data if I stop paying?",
          "a": "Your organization is disabled, not deleted. Everything stays readable so you can export it; writing is what stops. Re-enable and it picks up where it left off."
        },
        {
          "q": "Does it work on a phone?",
          "a": "Yes. The whole system is built for a phone first — the yard is not a place to carry a laptop — and the same screens expand on desktop."
